  "selection": "All rows eligible, including negatives; lowest SHA256 of UTF8(OSwind Few-NERD entity membership v1/SPLIT/ID), ties by string ID. Fixed256 validation and1024 test rows; no test-result selection.",
  "text": "Tokens joined with exactly one ASCII space; gold offsets measured as UTF16 code units. Artificial punctuation spacing can affect tagging.",
  "projection": "Coarse person7\u2192person, organization5\u2192organization, location4 and building2\u2192place. Other categories excluded from target labels. Contiguous equal fine/coarse IO tags form a span; adjacent different fine tags remain separate. This is an OSwind projection, not the published66-type Few-NERD task.",
  "metric": "Exact NFC/whitespace-normalized lowercased typed surface per source, deduplicated across repeated names. Primary membership micro/by-kind precision, recall and F1. Anchored membership additionally requires a valid exact UTF16 source slice matching any gold occurrence for that membership; repeated mentions do not inflate the denominator.",
  "limits": "Public English encyclopedia sentences, imperfect annotations and projection differences. No desktop/OCR/ASR multilingual, real identity resolution, full token-level NER, competitor app or top-three claim. Default source privacy transformations must be observed; source text must match gold before scoring.",
